@startwbs
<style>
wbsDiagram {
  .green * {
    BackgroundColor lightgreen
    FontColor darkgreen
  }
  .red * {
    BackgroundColor pink
  }
  :depth(2) {
    BackgroundColor lightblue
  }
}
</style>
* root
** branch A <<green>>
*** a1
**** a11 <<red>>
***** a111
*** a2
** branch B
*** b1 <<red>>
**** b11
@endwbs
